{"@type": "WebPage", "author": {"name": "UNDP Global Centre, Singapore", "image": {"url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQH7m9sAlxTcOQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1630620368197/undp_global_centre_singapore_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=vy5VeqgDs_mNz7oHDix-lh1E7UDGjJAYnhp0tkLiqUk", "@type": "ImageObject"}, "url": "https://sg.linkedin.com/company/undptechsingapore", "@type": "Organization", "interactionStatistic": {"@type": "InteractionCounter", "interactionType": "http://schema.org/FollowAction", "userInteractionCount": 9803}}, "headline": "What are #DigitalPublicGoods and why are they important?

When attention is focused on digital, it's often about trillion-dollar valuations and tech unicorns. But we also need to recognise the unsung heroes of digital transformation: digital public goods. Digital public goods are open-source software, open data, open AI models, open standards, and open content that are designed to improve lives and livelihoods around the world.

Access our latest joint blog with GovTech Singapore to learn why Singapore is building digital public goods ➡️ https://lnkd.in/g4WEJKN5"}

